      "message": "Merge upstream/main (70c261ba) into issue/155-pause-home-entries-v2\n\nBrings in #464 (fixture-law gaps), #462 (carry-machine check), #470\n(MCP setup/machine/fixture tools) and the orthographic-projection\nbrowser radios (30479ed7).\n\nConflict resolution:\n- crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs operation_type_menu_requires_confirm:\n  main moved the browser's first row from y 179 to y 200 (the new\n  projection radios above it); this branch added three menu rows\n  (pause / home / optional stop, #155), moving Face from 9.5 to 12.5\n  rows below the menu's top. Kept both: 200.0 base, 12.5 rows.\n- Not a textual conflict but the same shift: this branch's own\n  egui_app/tests/program_entry.rs clicked browser rows from the old\n  179.0 base; moved to 200.0 (its menu test fails on 179.0 against\n  main's layout, passes on 200.0).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
